DISCLAIMER (重要):

This software is a tool for analyzing publicly available data and visualizing
expected values in Japanese public boat racing (公営競技ボートレース).

- It is **NOT** a system that guarantees positive returns.
- Public boat racing has a structural takeout rate of 25%, meaning the
  long-term expected value is mathematically negative.
- Backtesting (Bootstrap CI on a leak-free test set) shows the model's best
  strategy converges to ROI -3.7% to -4.7% in real-world deployment.
- Use this software for educational, analytical, and personal entertainment
  purposes only. The authors assume no responsibility for any monetary loss
  resulting from its use.
- Gambling addiction is a serious issue. If you or someone you know struggles
  with gambling, please contact a support hotline.
